msgid "'Baking' an auto-layer will flatten it to create a new regular 'Tiles layer'. The copy will contain all the tiles generated from the auto-layer rules.\nWhat would you like to do with the original layer after baking it?"
msgstr "“烘焙”自动图层会将其扁平化为一个普通“图块图层”。该副本将包含自动图层规则生成的所有静态图块。\n烘焙后您希望如何处理原始自动图层？"

