msgid "9-slice scaling mode splits the selected texture in 9 sections (4 corners, 4 borders and 1 inner).\nCorners are drawn as-is, Borders are repeated on the sides of the entity, and Inner is stretch at the center of the entity.\nYou can adjust the size of up, down, left and right borders, in pixels."
