msgstr "项目未能正确保存！"

msgid "The select project doesn't match this backup."
msgstr "所选的项目与此备份文件不匹配。"

msgid "The selected file has a different name: are you sure it's the one? Selecting a different file could break existing data in this project!"
msgstr "所选文件具有不同的名称：确认是同一个文件吗？选取错误的文件可能会破坏本项目中的现有数据！"

msgid "The selected file has a different name: are you sure it's the one? Selecting a different file may have dramatic results."
msgstr "所选文件具有不同的名称：确认是同一个文件吗？选取错误的文件可能会破坏本项目中的现有数据！"

msgid "These examples showcase various functionalities from LDtk editor, including auto-layer rules and entities."
msgstr "这些示例展示了 LDtk 编辑器的各种强大功能，包括自动图层规则和实体系统。"

msgid "These parallax factors are applied to the layer (coordinates and scale) to make it move \"slower\" or \"faster\" than the camera, creating a fake 3D depth effect.\n				- Greater than zero factor will make the layer movement slower than the camera (eg. mountains in a far background).\n				- Zero means the layer moves at the same rate as the camera.\n				- Less than zero means the layer moves faster than the camera (eg. fog in the foreground)"
msgstr "视差滚动因子会应用到该图层（坐标和缩放），使得摄像机镜头移动时该图层产生更慢或更快的立体景深移动效果。"

msgid "These parallax factors are applied to the layer (coordinates and scale) to make it move \"slower\" or \"faster\" than the camera, creating a fake 3D depth effect. - Greater than zero factor will make the layer movement slower than the camera (eg. mountains in a far background). - Zero means the layer moves at the same rate as the camera. - Less than zero means the layer moves faster than the camera (eg. fog in the foreground)"
msgstr "视差滚动因子会应用到该图层（坐标和缩放），使得摄像机镜头移动时该图层产生更慢或更快的立体景深移动效果。"

msgid "These parallax factors are applied to the layer (coordinates and scale) to make it move slower/faster when the camera moves."
msgstr "视差滚动因子会应用到该图层（坐标和缩放），使得摄像机镜头移动时该图层产生更慢或更快的立体景深移动效果。"

msgid "These tags are used to filter elements from your layer list in the main editor panel."
msgstr "这些筛选标签用于在主编辑界面的图层列表中快速筛选并查找特定图层。"

msgid "These values describe how tiles are arranged inside the source image.\n			You can check the preview of the tile grid below.\n			Tiles are listed as a grid, from left to right, top to bottom, and their index starts at ZERO."
msgstr "这些参数描述了图块在源图像中的排列方式。您可以在下方查看图块网格预览。图块按网格排列，从左到右，从上到下，索引从 0 开始。"

msgid "These values describe how tiles are arranged inside the source image. You can change them at any time without losing any tile placement."
msgstr "这些参数定义了图块在源图像中的网格排列方式。您可以随时安全地调整它们，而不会丢失关卡中的图块放置记录。"

msgid "These values describe how tiles are arranged inside the source image. You can check the preview of the tile grid below. Tiles are listed as a grid, from left to right, top to bottom, and their index starts at ZERO."
msgstr "这些参数描述了图块在源图像中的排列方式。您可以在下方查看图块网格预览。图块按网格排列，从左到右，从上到下，索引从 0 开始。"

