msgid "Warning! This IntGrid layer is used by another one as SOURCE. Deleting it will also delete all rules in the corresponding auto-layer(s)!\n You may want to change these layers source to another one before..."
msgstr "警告！此 IntGrid 图层正作为另一个自动图层的“计算数据源”。删除它将同时删除对应自动图层中的所有规则！\n在删除前您可能需要先将这些自动图层的源更改为其他图层..."

msgid "Warning: by removing the OPTIONAL status of this group, you will lose the on/off state of this group in all existing levels."
msgstr "警告：取消该规则组的“可选”属性，将导致该规则组在所有现有关卡中的启用/关闭独立开关状态丢失。"

msgid "Warning: by removing the OPTIONAL status of this group, you will lose the on/off state of this group in all levels. The group of rules will become a 'global' one, applied to every levels."
msgstr "警告：取消该规则组的“可选”属性，将导致该规则组在所有关卡中的启用/关闭状态丢失。该规则组将变为全局规则组，应用于所有关卡。"

msgid "Warning: the TILESET grid (::tileset::px) differs from the LAYER grid (::layer::px), and the values aren't multiples, which can lead to unexpected behaviors when adding a group of tiles."
msgstr "警告：图块集网格 (::tileset::px) 与图层网格 (::layer::px) 不一致，且两者不是整数倍关系，添加图块组时可能会出现非预期表现。"

msgid "Warning: the TILESET grid (::tileset::px) differs from the LAYER grid (::layer::px). This may lead to unexpected results!"
msgstr "警告：图块集网格大小 (::tileset::px) 与图层网格大小 (::layer::px) 不一致。这可能会导致渲染对齐出现非预期偏差！"

msgid "Warning: using this tileset in this layer will mess any existing tiles here."
msgstr "警告：在此图层中更换为此图块集将可能打乱当前图层中已存在的图块排布。"

